{"version":1,"key":"card:152","content":{"id":152,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2a58f8d8-23dc-49b7-a546-f3803b03c202","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"takeRecords()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，可以在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"mutations"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 被回调函数处理之前拦截到。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"a41ccba1-7758-4c3d-b825-ac1579116ad2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"94a2827c-df08-4758-b358-db4c99866dc3","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<ul id=\"list\">\n  <li>篮球</li>\n  <li>足球</li>\n  <li>羽毛球</li>\n</ul>","collabId":"c490ba32-609b-4e31-8b2b-a9f8a97ae5ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"16bf6e68-9673-4a01-a0ad-502fe6d9af71","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f6929fc0-69c4-4d36-8006-320aa1dcb038","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const list = document.querySelector('#list');\nconst observer = new MutationObserver(mutations => {\n  console.log('callback:', mutations);\n});\nobserver.observe(list, {\n  childList: true\n});\n\nsetTimeout(() => {\n  list.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend', '\\n<li>乒乓球</li>');\n  const records = observer.takeRecords();\n  console.log('takeRecords:', records);\n}, 3000);","collabId":"a8bbe5f5-5fc5-43d7-998b-ad600be61282","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"240e9063-567e-4e8e-8311-a605226b58d2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们准备了一个列表，使用一个定时器向列表中添加一项内容，添加内容之后，我们马上使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"takeRecords()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行了拦截，因此不会触发回调函数的执行。"}]}],"tags":["DOM/Mutation Observer"],"createTime":1690161174105,"updateTime":1743303640405,"linkedCards":[{"id":148,"target":{"key":"card:148","type":"card","id":148},"summary":"在复杂的网页应用中，DOM 结构会频繁的发生变化，有的时候我们需要根据变化来进行相应的操作，以往通过 Mutation Events 来监听 DOM 的变化，目前它已经废弃了，被 MutationObserver 所取代。 Mutation...","tags":["DOM/Mutation Observer"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640405}}